# HELP sglang:load_back_tokens_total The number of tokens loaded back from local host DRAM (L2) to GPU, by host pool (kv, swa, mamba, ...). Every TP rank reports the same logical count under its own rank labels; read one rank rather than summing ranks.
# TYPE sglang:load_back_tokens_total counter
sglang:load_back_tokens_total{cache_type="UnifiedRadixCache",dp_rank="0",pool="kv",pp_rank="0",tp_rank="0"} 78464.0
# HELP sglang:load_back_bytes_total Bytes loaded back from local host DRAM (L2) to GPU, all pools combined, including draft/sidecar transfers that the token counter excludes. Each rank reports its own KV shard; sum ranks for the physical total. A window's byte delta divided by the same window's load_back_duration_seconds sum is the bytes-weighted active bandwidth; the plain rate is wall-clock payload traffic that includes idle time.
# TYPE sglang:load_back_bytes_total counter
sglang:load_back_bytes_total{cache_type="UnifiedRadixCache",dp_rank="0",pp_rank="0",tp_rank="0"} 4.333095936e+09
# HELP sglang:load_back_duration_seconds GPU-stream span of a merged host-to-device load-back copy loop, including gaps between per-layer I/O submissions but excluding pre-transfer queue and fence waits.
